/*
 * TitoPay — customer app (PWA)
 *
 * One classic script, loaded by index.html and cached by the service worker.
 * Functions are grouped by domain below; a function declaration is hoisted, so
 * its position in this file has no effect on behaviour and sections can be
 * reordered freely.
 *
 * Anything that is NOT a function declaration — the constants, the module-level
 * state, the polyfills and the event wiring — is order-sensitive. Those
 * statements live in the two banner-marked blocks at the top and the bottom, in
 * their original order. Add new constants to the top block and new wiring to the
 * bottom one; put new functions in whichever section below they belong to.
 *
 * Contents
 *
 *    1. Core helpers                        10 functions
 *    2. Formatting and normalising          14 functions
 *    3. API client and connectivity          9 functions
 *    4. Navigation, routing and the shells  32 functions
 *    5. Shared UI pieces                    25 functions
 *    6. Forms, inputs and event handling    14 functions
 *    7. Sign in, registration and OTP       38 functions
 *    8. Security, devices and the session   28 functions
 *    9. Profile, settings and preferences   33 functions
 *   10. Wallet, balances and activity       38 functions
 *   11. Top-up and withdrawal               29 functions
 *   12. Transfers, recipients and splitting  53 functions
 *   13. Statements, receipts and documents  81 functions
 *   14. Airtime, data, electricity and vouchers  78 functions
 *   15. QR codes and scanning               31 functions
 *   16. Merchant and point of sale          26 functions
 *   17. Business, enterprise and bulk distribution  25 functions
 *   18. Stockvels and savings groups        69 functions
 *   19. Events and ticketing                42 functions
 *   20. Chat, calls and support            104 functions
 *   21. Learn and guidance                  14 functions
 *   22. Service catalogue                   32 functions
 *   23. Notifications                        4 functions
 *   24. KYC, FICA and verification          56 functions
 */
